### ==============================================================================
### Employee Data Management Portal - API Tests (REST Client)
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client extension, IntelliJ HTTP Client, etc.
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Dean Login (Valid credentials)
# @name deanLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dean/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "dean",
  "password": "dean123"
}

### Save Dean token
@deanToken = {{deanLogin.response.body.token}}

### 1.2 Employee Login (Valid credentials)
# @name employeeLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "employee",
  "password": "emp123"
}

### Save Employee token
@employeeToken = {{employeeLogin.response.body.token}}

### 1.3 Dean Registration (Requires Dean Access Code DEAN2026)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dean/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newdean",
  "email": "newdean@portal.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "New Dean",
  "deanAccessCode": "DEAN2026"
}

### 1.4 Employee Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/employee/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newemp",
  "email": "newemp@portal.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "New Staff Member"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. DATASET LIFECYCLE (DEAN ONLY)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get Active Dataset Metadata & Columns (Dean or Employee)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataset/active
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 2.2 Download Standardized XML Representation (Dean only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataset/xml
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 2.3 Upload Dataset (.xlsx, .csv, .json, or .xml) - Multipart form
# Note: For file uploads, use curl or the portal UI at http://localhost:5173/dean/dashboard
# Example curl:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/dataset/upload \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer <deanToken>" \
#   -F "file=@sample-data/Employees.xlsx"


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. RECORDS DIRECTORY & MANDATORY PAGINATION
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Get Paginated Records (Page 0, Size 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 3.2 Get Dynamic Filter Options (Categories + Numeric/Date Ranges)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/filter-options
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 3.3 Search across all columns
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?page=0&size=10&search=Egypt
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 3.4 Filter by Category (e.g., gender=Female & country=Egypt)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?page=0&size=10&eq_gender=Female&eq_country=Egypt
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 3.5 Filter by Numeric Range (min_monthly_salary & max_monthly_salary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?page=0&size=10&min_monthly_salary=1500&max_monthly_salary=2000
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 3.6 Filter by Date Range (from_start_date & to_start_date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?page=0&size=10&from_start_date=2018-01-01&to_start_date=2020-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. RECORD CRUD OPERATIONS (DEAN ONLY)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Add New Record (Dean only)
# @name createRecord
POST {{baseUrl}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "no": 9001,
    "first_name": "Alexander",
    "last_name": "Pierce",
    "gender": "Male",
    "start_date": "2023-05-10",
    "years": 2,
    "department": "Engineering",
    "country": "Egypt",
    "center": "Cairo",
    "monthly_salary": 3200,
    "annual_salary": 38400,
    "job_rate": 4.5,
    "sick_leaves": 2,
    "unpaid_leaves": 0,
    "overtime_hours": 15
  }
}

### Capture new record id
@createdId = {{createRecord.response.body.id}}

### 4.2 Get Record Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/{{createdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 4.3 Update Record (Dean only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/records/{{createdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "no": 9001,
    "first_name": "Alexander",
    "last_name": "Pierce",
    "gender": "Male",
    "start_date": "2023-05-10",
    "years": 3,
    "department": "Engineering",
    "country": "Egypt",
    "center": "Cairo",
    "monthly_salary": 3500,
    "annual_salary": 42000,
    "job_rate": 4.8,
    "sick_leaves": 1,
    "unpaid_leaves": 0,
    "overtime_hours": 10
  }
}

### 4.4 Delete Record (Dean only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/records/{{createdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. DUAL EXPORTS (DEAN & EMPLOYEE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Export Filtered Records as Excel (.xlsx via Apache POI SXSSFWorkbook)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/export/excel?eq_country=Egypt
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}

### 5.2 Export Filtered Records as CSV (.csv with UTF-8 BOM)
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/export?eq_country=Egypt
Authorization: Bearer {{deanToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. RBAC PERMISSION CHECKS (EMPLOYEE FORBIDDEN ACTIONS)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Employee attempts to Add Record (Must return 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "first_name": "Hacker"
  }
}

### 6.2 Employee attempts to Download Dataset XML (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataset/xml
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
